    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01176",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“我喜欢这里的色彩。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I like the colors here.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01176",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "冬日处处景色凄凉，不免使人感到黯然伤神，真扫兴啊。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "In winter, the scenery everywhere is bleak, and it inevitably makes one feel gloomy and dispirited; it is truly disappointing.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01176",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "这儿的景色却很雅致，令人神往。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But the scenery here is very refined and makes one long for it.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01176",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "我觉得这地方在日本也是少有的。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I think a place like this is rare even in Japan.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
